## 📱 API Structure (server_modern.js)

### **Authentication & Authorization**
```javascript
// Middleware
authenticateToken       // JWT verification
requireRole([roles])    // Role-based access control

// Supported roles: 'admin', 'guru', 'siswa'
```

### **Admin Endpoints** (/api/admin/*)
- Users: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE
- Guru: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE (transaction-based)
- Siswa: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE (transaction-based, smart delete)
- Kelas: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE (with ruang & kode_ruang)
- Jadwal: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE (multi-guru support)
- Mapel: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE
- Ruang Kelas: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE
- Reports: attendance, banding, performance

### **Guru Endpoints** (/api/guru/*)
- Schedule: GET (multi-guru)
- Classes: GET assigned classes
- Attendance: GET, POST, PUT (multi-guru)
- Banding: GET list, PUT respond (multi-guru)
- Reports: student attendance history

### **Siswa Endpoints** (/api/siswa/*)
- Profile: GET info, PUT update, PUT change password
- Jadwal: GET hari ini, GET rentang
- Kehadiran Guru: POST submit (multi-guru), GET riwayat
- Daftar Siswa: GET classmates
- Banding: GET list, POST individual, POST class (1 student)

